          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "आगाऊ — āgāū — \"in advance\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "सहलीचे पैसे आम्ही आगाऊ भरले. sahlīce paise āmhī āgāū bharle. We paid for the trip in advance."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "आगाऊ (āgāū), \"ahead of time\", is perhaps kin to Marathi agāv, \"in front\", which CDIAL sets under Sanskrit agra, \"top, front\" (CDIAL 68). CDIAL lists no आगाऊ itself, so the link is not settled."
            }
          ]
        },
