              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ऐनवेळी — ainveḷī — \"at the last moment\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ऐनवेळी गाडी बिघडली आणि आम्ही उशिरा पोहोचलो. ainveḷī gāḍī bighaḍlī āṇi āmhī uśirā pohoclo. At the last moment the car broke down and we arrived late."
            }
